==== Known Issues ====

  * Switch acts weird (forwarding broadcast frames to all ports) [[https://dev.openwrt.org/ticket/14439#comment:19|ticket 14439]] [[https://dev.openwrt.org/ticket/15511|ticket 15511]] can be fixed this way [[https://github.com/grobian/openwrt/commit/2c1b37d91f973568f2f1e109e15efbf973f684d7|disable SW_ROUTING]]
  * Switch doesn't allow tagged and untagged traffic on the same port, can be fixed with with [[https://github.com/grobian/openwrt/commit/3407f1486738071efc7952fecf5cb8d7ec9dc7e2|Martin Schiller's changes]]
  * Failsafe-Mode is __not__ accessible via ethernet when triggered with the WPS button and indicated by led.  (fixed for [[https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/commit/6fb0defebb305b3f2d32c351e3c017ea8b45b17a|TDW8970]])


